Mike Fournier wrote:
> 1) What, in your opinion would be the best artifact weapon to use with the
> Valkyrie.  In my present game I  used a wish to obtain Gauntlets of power,
> so my Str is now 25. I have also offered sacrifices to my god Odin and 
have
> obtained the WarHammer Mjolnir.  Is this in fact the best thing for my
> Valkyrie to do? Are the better and more powerful options for her?

Valkyries are one of my favorites.  Mjollnir is pretty solid as far as 
weapons go.  I used to throw it constantly once I got the GoP, but nowadays 
I throw it much less.
1. It doesn't always come back.  ALWAYS have a back up weapon ready.
2. It sometimes strikes you.  This hurts a lot if you don't have shock 
resistance (which for me doesn't usually come early in the game), and even 
if you do, it can still vaporize your rings and wands.

Also, for your backup, avoid using Vorpal Blade unless you have nothing 
better.  Its beheading attack is not something you want to be hoping for 
when fighting the Wizard.  Prefer Fire Brand or Frost Brand.  Even a plain 
long sword at least you can #twoweap with.

